### Variables
@baseUrl = http://localhost:3000/api
@userToken = Bearer REPLACE_USER_TOKEN
@companyToken = Bearer REPLACE_COMPANY_TOKEN

### ═══════════════════════════════════════
### AUTH
### ═══════════════════════════════════════

### Register User
POST {{baseUrl}}/auth/register/user
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "name": "أحمد محمد",
  "email": "ahmed@example.com",
  "password": "SecurePass123",
  "years_of_experience": 5,
  "career_level": 3,
  "field_id": 1,
  "current_location_id": 1,
  "desired_salary_min": 15000,
  "desired_salary_max": 25000
}

### Register Company
POST {{baseUrl}}/auth/register/company
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "name": "TechCorp",
  "email": "hr@techcorp.com",
  "password": "CompanyPass123",
  "industry": 1,
  "company_size": 4,
  "location_id": 1,
  "founded_year": 2015,
  "website": "https://techcorp.com"
}

### Login User
POST {{baseUrl}}/auth/login
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "email": "ahmed@example.com",
  "password": "SecurePass123",
  "type": "user"
}

### Login Company
POST {{baseUrl}}/auth/login
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "email": "hr@techcorp.com",
  "password": "CompanyPass123",
  "type": "company"
}

### ═══════════════════════════════════════
### USER
### ═══════════════════════════════════════

### Get Profile
GET {{baseUrl}}/users/profile
Authorization: {{userToken}}

### Update Profile
PUT {{baseUrl}}/users/profile
Authorization: {{userToken}}
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "years_of_experience": 6,
  "career_level": 3
}

### Add Skills
POST {{baseUrl}}/users/skills
Authorization: {{userToken}}
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "skills": [
    { "skill_id": 1, "level": 5 },
    { "skill_id": 2, "level": 4 },
    { "skill_id": 3, "level": 3 }
  ]
}

### Update Preferences
POST {{baseUrl}}/users/preferences
Authorization: {{userToken}}
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "preferred_field_id": 1,
  "preferred_job_level": 3,
  "preferred_employment_type": 1,
  "remote_preference": 2,
  "min_salary": 16000
}

### Add Preferred Locations
POST {{baseUrl}}/users/preferred-locations
Authorization: {{userToken}}
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "locations": [
    { "location_id": 1, "priority": 5 },
    { "location_id": 2, "priority": 3 }
  ]
}

### ═══════════════════════════════════════
### COMPANY
### ═══════════════════════════════════════

### Get Company Profile
GET {{baseUrl}}/companies/profile/me
Authorization: {{companyToken}}

### Update Company Profile
PUT {{baseUrl}}/companies/profile
Authorization: {{companyToken}}
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "name": "TechCorp International",
  "website": "https://techcorp.io"
}

### Get Company Public Info
GET {{baseUrl}}/companies/1

### ═══════════════════════════════════════
### JOBS
### ═══════════════════════════════════════

### Create Job (Company)
POST {{baseUrl}}/jobs
Authorization: {{companyToken}}
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "title": "Senior Data Scientist",
  "field_id": 1,
  "job_level": 3,
  "location_id": 1,
  "min_experience": 4,
  "max_experience": 8,
  "salary_min": 18000,
  "salary_max": 28000,
  "employment_type": 1,
  "remote_option": 2,
  "expires_at": "2030-06-30T00:00:00.000Z"
}

### List Jobs with Filters
GET {{baseUrl}}/jobs?field_id=1&job_level=3&location_id=1

### Get Job Details
GET {{baseUrl}}/jobs/1

### Add Job Skills
POST {{baseUrl}}/jobs/1/skills
Authorization: {{companyToken}}
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "skills": [
    { "skill_id": 1, "importance": 5, "is_required": 1 },
    { "skill_id": 2, "importance": 4, "is_required": 1 },
    { "skill_id": 3, "importance": 3, "is_required": 0 }
  ]
}

### Get My Jobs (Company)
GET {{baseUrl}}/jobs/my-jobs/list
Authorization: {{companyToken}}

### ═══════════════════════════════════════
### INTERACTIONS
### ═══════════════════════════════════════

### User Interaction with Job
POST {{baseUrl}}/interactions
Authorization: {{userToken}}
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "job_id": 1,
  "interaction_type": 1
}

### User Interactions History
GET {{baseUrl}}/interactions/my-history
Authorization: {{userToken}}

### Company-Candidate Interaction
POST {{baseUrl}}/interactions/company-interactions
Authorization: {{companyToken}}
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "user_id": 1,
  "job_id": 1,
  "interaction_type": 2
}

### Company Interactions History
GET {{baseUrl}}/interactions/company-interactions/history
Authorization: {{companyToken}}

### ═══════════════════════════════════════
### APPLICATIONS
### ═══════════════════════════════════════

### Apply for Job
POST {{baseUrl}}/applications
Authorization: {{userToken}}
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "job_id": 1
}

### My Applications
GET {{baseUrl}}/applications/my-applications
Authorization: {{userToken}}

### Applicants for Job (Company)
GET {{baseUrl}}/applications/job/1
Authorization: {{companyToken}}

### Update Application Status
PUT {{baseUrl}}/applications/1/status
Authorization: {{companyToken}}
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "status": 3
}

### ═══════════════════════════════════════
### REFERENCE DATA
### ═══════════════════════════════════════

### Get Locations
GET {{baseUrl}}/locations

### Get Fields
GET {{baseUrl}}/fields

### Get Skills (with filter)
GET {{baseUrl}}/skills?field_id=1

### Get All Enums
GET {{baseUrl}}/enums

### ═══════════════════════════════════════
### RECOMMENDATIONS (via Backend)
### ═══════════════════════════════════════

### Get my job recommendations (User, hybrid)
GET {{baseUrl}}/recommendations/jobs/me?limit=10&method=hybrid
Authorization: {{userToken}}

### Get my job recommendations (Content-Based only)
GET {{baseUrl}}/recommendations/jobs/me?limit=10&method=content
Authorization: {{userToken}}

### Get my job recommendations (Collaborative only)
GET {{baseUrl}}/recommendations/jobs/me?limit=10&method=collaborative
Authorization: {{userToken}}

### Get candidate recommendations for a job (Company)
GET {{baseUrl}}/recommendations/candidates/1?limit=10&method=hybrid
Authorization: {{companyToken}}

### Get recommendations for specific user (Public/Admin)
GET {{baseUrl}}/recommendations/jobs/user/1?limit=5

### ML Service Health Check (via backend)
GET {{baseUrl}}/recommendations/ml/health

